## Small Source or Summary Files

| File | Format | Purpose | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| Genome sequence | FASTA (.fasta) | Contains the complete *Zea mays* chloroplast genome sequence for upload to Galaxy and sequence analysis. | NCBI RefSeq, **NC_001666.2** |
| Annotated genome | GenBank (.gb / .gbk) | Contains annotated genes, gene coordinates, CDS, tRNA, rRNA, introns, and other genome features. | NCBI RefSeq, **NC_001666.2** |
| Genome summary | TXT / Markdown (.txt / .md) | Summarizes the organism, accession number, genome size, GC content, and genome organization. | NCBI RefSeq, **NC_001666.2** |
| Source information | TXT / Markdown (.txt / .md) | Records the database source and accession used for the analysis. | [NCBI Nucleotide – NC_001666.2](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/nuccore/NC_001666.2) |
